{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2023-04-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES SMYTH EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT GRID SOLUTIONS & GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS, ANNOUNCES ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) HAS MADE ORGANIZATIONAL AND EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP CHANGES TO SUPPORT THE COMPANY'S STRATEGIC PRIORITIES, ACCORDING TO JULIE SLOAT, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. THE CHANGES ARE EFFECTIVE TODAY."}